       \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","[doc_005] 注入攻擊（Injection） (0.8440)\n","注入攻擊（Injection）\n","\n","注入攻擊發生在應用程式把不可信任的輸入當成指令或查詢的一部分處理時。攻擊者可能改變資料庫查詢、命令或其他解譯器的執行語意。常見相關例子包括 SQL Injection；問題核心是程式碼與資料沒有被正確區隔。\n","來源： https://top10.owasp.org/2025/A05_2025-Injection/\n","\n","[doc_002] 安全設定錯誤（Security Misconfiguration） (0.6880)\n","安全設定錯誤（Security Misconfiguration）\n","\n","安全設定錯誤是應用程式、框架、伺服器、雲端服務或相關元件採用了不安全的設定。例如預設帳號未停用、正式環境開啟除錯模式、權限過寬、暴露不必要的服務或缺少安全標頭，都會增加攻擊面。\n","來源： https://top10.owasp.org/2025/A02_2025-Security_Misconfiguration/\n","\n","[doc_008] 軟體或資料完整性失效（Software or Data Integrity Failures） (0.6675)\n","軟體或資料完整性失效（Software or Data Integrity Failures）\n","\n","完整性保護是為了確保軟體、設定及資料未遭未授權或非預期的變更。如果系統信任沒有適當驗證的更新、外部資料或序列化內容，便可能產生完整性風險。此類問題與驗證來源及防止未經授權的修改密切相關。\n","來源： https://top10.owasp.org/2025/A08_2025-Software_or_Data_Integrity_Failures/\n"]}],"source":["QUESTION = \"什麼是SQL injection？\"\n","TOP_K = 3\n","results = search_documents(QUESTION, TOP_K)\n","display(pd.DataFrame([\n","    {\"排名\": r[\"rank\"], \"doc_id\": r[\"doc_id\"], \"標題\": r[\"metadata\"][\"title\"],\n","     \"cosine_similarity\": r[\"score\"], \"來源\": r[\"metadata\"][\"source_url\"]}\n","    for r in results\n","]))\n","for result in results:\n","    print(f\"\\n[{result['doc_id']}] {result['metadata']['title']} ({result['score']:.4f})\")\n","    print(result[\"text\"])\n","    print(\"來源：\", result[\"metadata\"][\"source_url\"] or \"未提供\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"7611b770","metadata":{"id":"7611b770"},"source":["## 14. 保存索引、文件、編號對照與設定\n","\n","第二份 Colab 需要下面四個檔案，不能只拿 FAISS 索引：\n","\n","| 檔案 | 用途 |\n","|---|---|\n","| `index.faiss` | 文件向量與搜尋索引 |\n","| `documents.json` | 取回後提供給 LLM 的正文與來源資訊 |\n","| `index_doc_ids.json` | FAISS 編號對應的文件編號 |\n","| `config.json` | 模型確切版本、前綴、維度、正規化、套件版本及檢查資訊 |\n","\n","不保存模型權重、API 金鑰或其他環境變數。第二份 Colab 載入相同模型版本，只重新計算問題向量。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":35,"id":"068b87ce","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"068b87ce","outputId":"743f77b7-5865-48ef-fe7c-e4f326dbb410","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793606271271,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":9,"user":{"displayName":"宗諺","userId":"16953460375844362090"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["已保存：\n","config.json (1,383 bytes)\n","documents.json (7,532 bytes)\n","index.faiss (30,765 bytes)\n","index_doc_ids.json (132 bytes)\n","\n","模型版本及前綴已寫入 config.json。\n"]}],"source":["EXPORT_DIR = Path(tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"rag_index_\"))\n","faiss.write_index(index, str(EXPORT_DIR / \"index.faiss\"))\n","\n","for filename, data in [(\"documents.json\", documents), (\"index_doc_ids.json\", index_doc_ids)]:\n","    (EXPORT_DIR / filename).write_text(\n","        json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\"\n","    )\n","\n","config = {\n","    \"format_version\": \"1.0\",\n","    \"created_at\": datetime.now(ZoneInfo(\"Asia/Taipei\")).isoformat(timespec=\"seconds\"),\n","    \"model_id\": MODEL_ID,\n","    \"model_revision\": MODEL_REVISION,\n","    \"model_config_kwargs\": {\"vision_config\": None, \"audio_config\": None},\n","    \"dimension\": DIMENSION,\n","    \"normalize_embeddings\": True,\n","    \"index_type\": \"IndexFlatIP\",\n","    \"metric\": \"cosine_similarity_via_normalized_inner_product\",\n","    \"document_template\": DOCUMENT_TEMPLATE,\n","    \"query_template\": QUERY_TEMPLATE,\n","    \"encode_prompt\": \"\",\n","    \"max_seq_length\": TOKEN_LIMIT,\n","    \"document_count\": len(documents),\n","    \"document_unit\": \"one_document_one_vector\",\n","    \"document_text_includes_title\": True,\n","    \"package_versions\": PACKAGE_VERSIONS,\n","    \"build_device\": DEVICE,\n","    \"build_dtype\": str(DTYPE),\n","    \"source_archive\": archive_name,\n","    \"source_archive_sha256\": SOURCE_ARCHIVE_SHA256,\n","    \"file_sha256\": {\n","        name: hashlib.sha256((EXPORT_DIR / name).read_bytes()).hexdigest()\n","        for name in [\"index.faiss\", \"documents.json\", \"index_doc_ids.json\"]\n","    },\n","}\n","(EXPORT_DIR / \"config.json\").write_text(\n","    json.dumps(config, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\"\n",")\n","print(\"已保存：\")\n","for path in sorted(EXPORT_DIR.iterdir()):\n","    print(path.name, f\"({path.stat().st_size:,} bytes)\")\n","print(\"\\n模型版本及前綴已寫入 config.json。\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"c2f5e2c0","metadata":{"id":"c2f5e2c0"},"source":["## 15. 重新載入，驗證第二份 Colab 所需的資料\n","\n","從剛才保存的檔案重新載入，檢查完整性、文件編號與向量對應，再使用**同一個問題向量**比對保存前後的排名與分數。此處不重算問題向量，以免不同運算裝置的細微浮點誤差干擾索引保存檢查。\n","\n","也將 FAISS 結果與 NumPy 的全矩陣內積排序比較，確認精確搜尋的意義。遇到完全同分時，兩套工具的同分排列順序可以不同。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":36,"id":"ce699560","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"ce699560","outputId":"942ec6a2-d5f2-4d7a-88ad-645c8b75b81e","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793606273490,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":66,"user":{"displayName":"宗諺","userId":"16953460375844362090"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["通過：檔案完整性、文件對照、索引維度、保存前後一致，以及精確搜尋檢查。\n"]}],"source":["loaded_config = json.loads((EXPORT_DIR / \"config.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n","for name, expected_hash in loaded_config[\"file_sha256\"].items():\n","    actual_hash = hashlib.sha256((EXPORT_DIR / name).read_bytes()).hexdigest()\n","    assert actual_hash == expected_hash, f\"檔案完整性檢查失敗：{name}\"\n","\n","loaded_index = faiss.read_index(str(EXPORT_DIR / \"index.faiss\"))\n","loaded_documents = json.loads((EXPORT_DIR / \"documents.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n","loaded_ids = json.loads((EXPORT_DIR / \"index_doc_ids.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n","assert loaded_index.ntotal == len(loaded_documents) == len(loaded_ids) == loaded_config[\"document_count\"]\n","assert loaded_index.d == loaded_config[\"dimension\"]\n","assert len(set(loaded_ids)) == len(loaded_ids)\n","assert set(loaded_ids) == {doc[\"doc_id\"] for doc in loaded_documents}\n","assert loaded_documents == documents and loaded_ids == index_doc_ids\n","\n","verification_query = embed_question(QUESTION)\n","k = min(TOP_K, index.ntotal)\n","before_scores, before_positions = index.search(verification_query, k)\n","after_scores, after_positions = loaded_index.search(verification_query, k)\n","np.testing.assert_array_equal(before_positions, after_positions)\n","np.testing.assert_allclose(before_scores, after_scores, atol=1e-6, rtol=1e-6)\n","\n","all_scores = (embeddings @ verification_query[0]).ravel()\n","expected_top_scores = np.sort(all_scores)[::-1][:k]\n","np.testing.assert_allclose(after_scores[0], expected_top_scores, atol=1e-5, rtol=1e-5)\n","np.testing.assert_allclose(after_scores[0], all_scores[after_positions[0]], atol=1e-5, rtol=1e-5)\n","print(\"通過：檔案完整性、文件對照、索引維度、保存前後一致，以及精確搜尋檢查。\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"8f995fc4","metadata":{"id":"8f995fc4"},"source":["## 16. 打包並下載知識庫\n","\n","ZIP 根目錄包含前述四個檔案。下載後，留給第二份 Colab 上傳使用；模型權重不在 ZIP 裡。\n","\n","如果你更換文件、修改擷取函式或 embedding 設定，請重新執行受影響步驟並重新匯出，不要混用舊索引與新文件。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":37,"id":"ffccd7a9","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":54},"id":"ffccd7a9","outputId":"8ec7529e-77a1-4c6a-ef04-b79f00442e78","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793606275409,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":11,"user":{"displayName":"宗諺","userId":"16953460375844362090"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["下載檔名： vector_embedding.zip\n","大小： 23,073 bytes\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Javascript object>"],"application/javascript":["\n","    async function download(id, filename, size) {\n","      if (!google.colab.kernel.accessAllowed) {\n","        return;\n","      }\n","      const div = document.createElement('div');\n","      const label = document.createElement('label');\n","      label.textContent = `Downloading \"${filename}\": `;\n","      div.appendChild(label);\n","      const progress = document.createElement('progress');\n","      progress.max = size;\n","      div.appendChild(progress);\n","      document.body.appendChild(div);\n","\n","      const buffers = [];\n","      let downloaded = 0;\n","\n","      const channel = await google.colab.kernel.comms.open(id);\n","      // Send a message to notify the kernel that we're ready.\n","      channel.send({})\n","\n","      for await (const message of channel.messages) {\n","        // Send a message to notify the kernel that we're ready.\n","        channel.send({})\n","        if (message.buffers) {\n","          for (const buffer of message.buffers) {\n","            buffers.push(buffer);\n","            downloaded += buffer.byteLength;\n","            progress.value = downloaded;\n","          }\n","        }\n","      }\n","      const blob = new Blob(buffers, {type: 'application/binary'});\n","      const a = document.createElement('a');\n","      a.href = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n","      a.download = filename;\n","      div.appendChild(a);\n","      a.click();\n","      div.remove();\n","    }\n","  "]},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Javascript object>"],"application/javascript":["download(\"download_23123e02-e4aa-4bbb-904c-55c1066d7a8e\", \"vector_embedding.zip\", 23073)"]},"metadata":{}}],"source":["EXPORT_ZIP = EXPORT_DIR.parent / f\"{EXPORT_DIR.name}_download\" / EXPORT_ZIP_NAME\n","EXPORT_ZIP.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","required_files = [\"index.faiss\", \"documents.json\", \"index_doc_ids.json\", \"config.json\"]\n","with zipfile.ZipFile(EXPORT_ZIP, \"w\", compression=zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as archive:\n","    for name in required_files:\n","        archive.write(EXPORT_DIR / name, arcname=name)\n","with zipfile.ZipFile(EXPORT_ZIP) as archive:\n","    assert archive.testzip() is None\n","    assert set(archive.namelist()) == set(required_files)\n","print(\"下載檔名：\", EXPORT_ZIP_NAME)\n","print(\"大小：\", f\"{EXPORT_ZIP.stat().st_size:,} bytes\")\n","files.download(str(EXPORT_ZIP))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"8229844c","metadata":{"id":"8229844c"},"source":["## 17. 換成自己的資料：修改清單與課堂練習\n","\n","1. 準備一篇一檔的 UTF-8 TXT，包成 ZIP；文件格式由你設計。\n","2. 修改 **`extract_rag_text()`**：哪些文字要搜尋，也要提供給 LLM？\n","3. 修改 **`extract_metadata()`**：哪些欄位用於來源、日期、分類或顯示？\n","4. 將 `EXPECTED_DOCUMENT_COUNT` 設為 `None` 或新資料的預期數量。\n","5. 先看一篇擷取結果，再批次整理。確認沒有把範例問題或答案集混入正文。\n","6. 從批次整理步驟重新建立向量及索引，並重新匯出。若新增 metadata 欄位，第二份 Colab 的顯示也要配合修改。\n","\n","**觀察問題：** 同一題改用 `top_k=1`、`3`、`5`，有哪些文章被取回？最高分文章能回答問題嗎？教材沒有答案時，為什麼搜尋仍有結果？\n","\n","本份只完成檢索，不會讓 LLM 產生答案。下一份才會讀取 Colab Secrets 名稱為 **`Groq`** 的密鑰，設定 `GROQ_API_KEY`，透過 AIsuite 呼叫 `groq:openai/gpt-oss-120b`，最後以 Gradio 展示。\n","\n","### 參考資料\n","\n","- [EmbeddingGemma 2 官方 Sentence Transformers 指引](https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/embeddinggemma/inference-embeddinggemma-with-sentence-transformers)：文字模式、精度與檢索前綴。\n","- [EmbeddingGemma 2 模型](https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2)\n","- [FAISS 入門與索引說明](https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/wiki/Getting-started)\n","\n","教材採用一篇一向量的設計。法規內容可能隨日期變動；來源網址可供追溯，這些摘要不能取代當時有效的法規與個案判斷。"]}],"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"https://github.com/yenlung/Generative-AI/blob/main/RAG_01_%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84_RAG_%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1.ipynb","timestamp":1793604349221}],"gpuType":"T4"},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.12"},"widgets":{"application/vnd.jupyter.widget-state+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"state":{"921a31190ce648e3ac94ab1e324fc53e":{"model_module":"@jupyter-widgets/controls","model_name":"HBoxModel","model_module_version":"1.5.0","state":{"_dom_classes":[],"_model_module":"@jupyter-widgets/controls","_model_module_version":"1.5.0","_model_name":"HBoxModel","_view_count":null,"_view_module":"@jupyter-widgets/controls","_view_module_version":"1.5.0","_view_name":"HBo